Return — return N
== crate::traits::describe
Entry — when describe(items) is called
Return — return format!("{:?}", items.first())
== crate::traits::largest
Entry — when largest(items) is called
Var — best = items[0]
Loop.ForEach — for each &item in items
  body:
    Branch — if item > best
      true:
        Assign — set best to item
      false:
Return — return best
